{
  "title": "7-Eleven · Health Cancel & Refund",
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "wFXCXqVSk"
      },
      "description": "อัตราส่วน Cancel ต่อ Charge — ปกติควรอยู่ต่ำกว่า 10%\n\nดูยังไง: threshold สีเหลือง = 10%, สีแดง = 30%\n\nถ้าพุ่งสูงกะทันหัน: ระบบภายใน 7-Eleven อาจมีปัญหาทำให้ส่ง cancel ซ้ำหรือ false cancel เข้ามา (Case #4)\n\nAction: ตรวจสอบฝั่ง 7-Eleven ว่า Cancel request มี payment_id ที่ valid หรือเปล่า",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 2
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green"
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 10
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 30
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 562
      },
      "id": 9028,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "wFXCXqVSk"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(SEVEN_CUSTOM_IN_GATEWAY_transaction_total{service=\"CANCEL\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(SEVEN_CUSTOM_IN_GATEWAY_transaction_total{service=\"CHARGE\"}[5m])) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "Cancel/Charge ratio %",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Cancel / Charge Ratio  (ปกติควร < 10%)  — ถ้าพุ่งแสดงว่า 7-11 ส่ง false cancel",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "bars": false,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "wFXCXqVSk"
      },
      "description": "เปรียบเทียบ volume Charge OK, Cancel OK และ Cancel Fail ในกราฟเดียว\n\nดูยังไง: ถ้า Cancel OK เริ่มใกล้เคียง Charge OK มากขึ้น นั่นคือ signal ที่ผิดปกติ\n\nเกี่ยวกับ: Case #4 — ใช้ panel นี้ยืนยันว่า Cancel จริงๆ หรือ false",
      "fill": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 570
      },
      "id": 9029,
      "lines": true,
      "linewidth": 1,
      "nullPointMode": "null",
      "stack": false,
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "wFXCXqVSk"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(SEVEN_CUSTOM_IN_GATEWAY_transaction_total{service=\"CHARGE\",status_code=\"200 OK\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "Charge OK",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "wFXCXqVSk"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(SEVEN_CUSTOM_IN_GATEWAY_transaction_total{service=\"CANCEL\",status_code=\"200 OK\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "Cancel OK",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "wFXCXqVSk"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(SEVEN_CUSTOM_IN_GATEWAY_transaction_total{service=\"CANCEL\",status_code!=\"200 OK\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "Cancel Fail",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Cancel — Volume vs Charge Volume  (เทียบกัน)",
      "type": "graph",
      "yaxes": [
        {
          "format": "short",
          "label": "",
          "logBase": 1,
          "show": true
        },
        {
          "format": "short",
          "show": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "bars": false,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "wFXCXqVSk"
      },
      "description": "จำนวน Refund สำเร็จและ fail จาก seven-custom-in-gateway\n\nดูยังไง: ถ้า Refund Fail สูงในช่วงที่มีปัญหาหมายความว่าระบบ refund กลับลูกค้าไม่สำเร็จ\n\nเกี่ยวกับ: Case #2 — ลูกค้าถูกตัดเงินแต่ Slip ไม่พิมพ์ ต้อง refund กลับ",
      "fill": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 570
      },
      "id": 9030,
      "lines": true,
      "linewidth": 1,
      "nullPointMode": "null",
      "stack": false,
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "wFXCXqVSk"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(SEVEN_CUSTOM_IN_GATEWAY_transaction_total{service=\"REFUNDS\",status_code=\"200 OK\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "Refund OK",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "wFXCXqVSk"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(SEVEN_CUSTOM_IN_GATEWAY_transaction_total{service=\"REFUNDS\",status_code!=\"200 OK\"}[1m])) by (status_code)",
          "legendFormat": "Refund Fail {{status_code}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Refund — Success / Fail  (Case #2: ตัดเงินแล้ว slip ไม่พิมพ์)",
      "type": "graph",
      "yaxes": [
